<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italian 10-year BTP sale.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italian 10-year BTP sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a seventh tranche of 1.5 trillion lire of 10-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTPs) carrying a 6.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   February 1, 2007   previous</p>
<p> Net Yield	 6.78 pct vs	6.32 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     7.69 pct vs	7.22 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price   94.40   vs     97.50</p>
<p> Bids		 2.344 trillion lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   1.500 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with the previous auction of a fifth tranche of the 10-year BTP on February 27.</p>
</text>
